  Local control-plane access

  Allow a local process on this machine to inspect this Codex
  session and steer only the currently active turn.

  This creates a per-instance local socket only after you opt
  in. Declining keeps the feature dormant and Codex will ask
  again on the next launch.

› 1. Allow local control plane  Start the local IPC socket for this
                                session.
  2. Decline for now            Do not start the socket for this
                                launch.

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
